**Central thesis:** Clark is a Type 1 who grades hours and correct decisions rather than results, so no outcome can close the audit — which is why she instantly rates herself a six.

The through-line was already strong. The problem was mechanical: six of eight section seams were cold starts, because the sections were written as excellent standalone units and then butted together.

